OL,3,GNEWSASerial abuser jailed for sexually
OL,4,Aassaulting woman in hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serial criminal who sexually
OL,7,Fassaulted a woman while she was in
OL,8,Fhospital has been jailed for 10 years.
OL,10,FA court heard Matthew Edgerton
OL,11,Frepeatedly abused the woman physically
OL,12,Fand sexually for more than two years.
OL,14,FA judge described the circumstances of
OL,15,Fthe attack in Dundee's Ninewells
OL,16,FHospital as "revolting to any person
OL,17,Fwith any sense of empathy or decency".
